      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORPEDO GIBLET (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 23.36 beating Right Path. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Well placed and will be tough to beat. PAW LAMPADES (4) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.87) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Expected to feature in the finish. PAW DANGER (5) is very good course and distance. Latest effort finished 3rd on September 8 over 410m at this track behind Groot Bale beaten 7 lengths (23.84) in a Grade 5. Looks a key player on best form. HAPPY AND NUMB (2) was below best last time at Bendigo (24.13) in a Free For All, finishing a 2.25 lengths fourth. Has already won four times from this draw.",
